2919 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Leading L\046D teams are making decisions grounded in real\055time data because what gets measured\054 gets improved\056\n\nWith 74\045 of organisations agreeing that data\055literate teams outperform their peers\054 L\046D teams are shifting focus to tools and skills that turn learning metrics into meaningful decisions\056 \050Source\072 DataCamp Data Literacy Report\051\n\nWhat L\046D teams should actually focus on now\077\n\n\005 Monitor impact\054 not just completions \023 Track whether learning translates into real\055world behaviour change and improved performance\056\n\005 Spot skill gaps early \023 Use learner performance and team metrics to anticipate where training will be needed next\056\n\005 Tie learning to business goals \023 Align your metrics with team KPIs like productivity\054 sales\054 or retention to show real ROI\056\n\005 Adjust fast\054 using real\055time insights \023 Let data guide your strategy updates\054 not quarterly reviews\056\n\nWhen L\046D is data\055driven\054 it becomes a strategic partner to the business\056\n\nWhat you\031ll gain\072\050\024\017 Clear visibility into what\031s working and what isn\031t\n\024\017 Less time spent reporting\054 more time spent improving\n\024\017 Faster decision\055making when learning gaps appear\n\024\017 Confidence when presenting training outcomes to leadership)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 2920 0 R
     /Pg 2907 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

